<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 13.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Dec 117.50 Jan 118.50</p>
<p>Midlands Dec 118.00 Jan/Mar 120.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon range Nov 98.00/97.50 Dec 99.00 Jan/Mar 103.00/02.50/02.00 Apr/Jun 105.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 100.00/99.50 Dec 100.50/100.00 Jan/Mar 103.50/03.00 Apr/Jun 105.50/04.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Nov 100.00 Jan/Mar 104.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jan/Mar 102.50 Apr/Jun 104.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr/Jun 107.00</p>
<p>Feed barley Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 98.00 Dec 99.00 Jan/Mar 101.00</p>
</text>
